Package: napiconfig
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: @MAINTAINER@
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.36), nginx, openssl, systemd, dbus, influxdb2, telegraf-light | telegraf
Recommends: netplan.io
Suggests: network-manager, u-boot-tools, snmpd, influxdb2-cli, mbusd, mbus-gw-t2r, ttyd
Conflicts: napi-api, napi-ui
Replaces: napi-api, napi-ui
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Homepage: https://github.com/lab240
Description: NaPi web configurator: API backend and web UI
 Web interface for NaPi devices: network, system services, time, sensors,
 Modbus gateway, SNMP, InfluxDB and web terminal.
 .
 napi-api @API_VERSION@ (FastAPI) with its own Python @PYTHON_VERSION@
 (python-build-standalone) in /opt/napiconfig, napi-ui @UI_VERSION@ (Vue 3)
 served by nginx over HTTPS. Works on any @ARCH@ Debian/Ubuntu with
 glibc >= 2.36 (Debian bookworm, trixie, Ubuntu noble).
